LC 560 — Subarray Sum Equals K
Pattern: Prefix Sum + HashMap
Time: O(n)
Space: O(n)

ALGO:
sum = 0
Store prefix sums in HashMap
Check if sum - k exists
Add its frequency to answer
Store current sum

CODE:
class Solution {
public:
    int subarraySum(vector<int>& nums, int k) {
        unordered_map<int, int> mp;
        mp[0] = 1;

        int sum = 0, ans = 0;

        for (int x : nums) {
            sum += x;

            if (mp.count(sum - k))
                ans += mp[sum - k];

            mp[sum]++;
        }

        return ans;
    }
};

EX:
[1,1,1], k = 2

sum=1 → need=-1 → not found ❌

sum=2 → need=0 → found ✅
→ [1,1]

sum=3 → need=1 → found ✅
→ [1,1]



